"We wish you well."
- Lime, Cherry, Bloodberry.

00:16:50.109 --> 00:16:51.975
And that wraps up the messages
for the White team!

00:16:54.546 --> 00:16:57.174
Otaru, congratulations on your debut!!

00:16:58.417 --> 00:17:01.387
Is there anyone special out
there you'd like to thank?

00:17:01.453 --> 00:17:02.477
Iooo

00:17:02.554 --> 00:17:05.353
I had forgotton
something important.

00:17:05.424 --> 00:17:06.186
Oh?

00:17:06.258 --> 00:17:08.920
They gave me so much...

00:17:09.762 --> 00:17:13.528
Happy days... The courage
to fight for someone...!

00:17:13.866 --> 00:17:17.825
Even the fight against Gartlant
was won because of them!

00:17:18.504 --> 00:17:19.471
Otaru...?

00:17:19.538 --> 00:17:21.006
But, here I am...

00:17:21.507 --> 00:17:23.066
...A TOTAL FOOL!

00:17:26.178 --> 00:17:28.010
I'm through with show biz!

00:17:33.385 --> 00:17:34.682
Otaru?!

00:17:34.753 --> 00:17:36.221
Otaru!

00:17:36.822 --> 00:17:39.154
What do you think you're doing?!
Get back up there!

00:17:39.625 --> 00:17:42.424
Let me through!
I have to go find them!

00:17:42.494 --> 00:17:47.125
What are you getting excited about?!
What's a marionette or two?

00:17:47.533 --> 00:17:49.001
What?!

00:17:50.569 --> 00:17:52.469
Don't play the upstart
with ME, little man!

00:17:52.538 --> 00:17:55.098
I've a fortune riding on you!

00:17:56.141 --> 00:17:57.609
Otaru?!?

00:18:02.081 --> 00:18:03.549
Outta my way™

00:18:08.554 --> 00:18:10.113
Old Gennai!

00:18:10.189 --> 00:18:12.214
We'll take care of things here!

00:18:13.692 --> 00:18:14.625
Guys...!

00:18:14.693 --> 00:18:16.024
You...

00:18:18.797 --> 00:18:20.697
We're not doin' this for you!

00:18:20.899 --> 00:18:23.630
You'd better bring them back,
or this could be YOU!

00:18:25.404 --> 00:18:26.701
YES, SIR!

00:18:26.772 --> 00:18:28.297
Come back here!!

00:18:45.657 --> 00:18:47.955
| suppose this is
"Goodbye, Japoness.”

00:18:48.026 --> 00:18:50.757
Yeah... Where do we go now?

00:18:51.096 --> 00:18:53.997
Who cares? Otaru won't be there.

00:18:54.266 --> 00:18:56.030
It doesn't matter where we go.

00:18:56.101 --> 00:18:57.569
That's true...

00:19:00.539 --> 00:19:02.405
The clouds are getting ominous.

00:19:02.474 --> 00:19:04.670
For now, let's move to
a forest or something...

00:19:04.743 --> 00:19:06.871
...that'll provide us
cover from the plasma.

00:19:23.495 --> 00:19:25.088
- Lime?!
- Not that way!!

00:19:25.564 --> 00:19:27.032
Lime!!!

00:19:31.036 --> 00:19:32.504
Come back!

00:19:34.573 --> 00:19:36.200
Come back!

00:19:46.785 --> 00:19:48.253
Lime!

00:19:49.655 --> 00:19:50.781
LIME!

00:19:50.856 --> 00:19:52.324
Get away from there!

00:19:58.230 --> 00:19:59.698
LIME?!?

00:20:12.477 --> 00:20:13.467
Otaru...

00:20:13.545 --> 00:20:16.173
What are you doing
out here, you fool?!

00:20:16.481 --> 00:20:19.075
|-I mean, I'm the one
who's a fool... Forgive me.

00:20:19.151 --> 00:20:21.483
But, Otaru! Don't you
have tobe on TV?

00:20:21.553 --> 00:20:22.952
No, not anymore!

00:20:23.021 --> 00:20:24.318
No more movie sets?

00:20:24.389 --> 00:20:26.858
No! Not even if it means
Terra |I splits in two!

00:20:27.893 --> 00:20:29.088
Master Otaru!

00:20:29.161 --> 00:20:30.629
Otaru...

00:20:31.563 --> 00:20:33.531
Let's go home...
...to the apartment!

00:20:37.536 --> 00:20:39.163
Otaru!!

00:20:40.439 --> 00:20:41.929
Hey, hey.

00:20:47.179 --> 00:20:50.911
And now, the messages
for the Red team!!

00:20:52.484 --> 00:20:53.952
That oughta do it.

00:20:58.223 --> 00:21:00.920
Otaru Mamiya: 'COURAGEOUS
FLOWER' - Still in Stock!

00:21:03.895 --> 00:21:05.385
"Kasahari Apartments”

00:21:05.464 --> 00:21:06.898
Ready, and...

00:21:07.199 --> 00:21:08.564
HEAVE-HO!

00:21:08.634 --> 00:21:10.659
- Okay!
- Heave-ho!

00:21:10.736 --> 00:21:12.761
Shall we have a break for tea?

00:21:12.838 --> 00:21:14.306
Thanks, Cherry!

00:21:17.376 --> 00:21:19.902
This is MUCH more my style!

00:21:20.178 --> 00:21:21.907
Hey, everyone!
You gotta see this!

00:21:24.116 --> 00:21:25.584
You're not funny!

00:21:26.184 --> 00:21:28.175
Doesn't he ever give up?

00:21:28.253 --> 00:21:30.312
Hannie is just not funny!

00:21:55.180 --> 00:21:58.946
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:21:59.017 --> 00:22:02.647
...don't go off to be alone.

00:22:02.788 --> 00:22:05.655
Just think of me...

00:22:05.724 --> 00:22:10.321
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:10.562 --> 00:22:14.328
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:14.399 --> 00:22:18.029
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:18.203 --> 00:22:21.935
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:22.007 --> 00:22:23.771
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:23.842 --> 00:22:27.801
You can't feel a thing.

00:22:29.881 --> 00:22:32.213
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:22:32.284 --> 00:22:37.245
...what they really feel inside?

00:22:37.456 --> 00:22:41.120
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:22:41.326 --> 00:22:44.887
...one step at a time.

00:22:45.130 --> 00:22:48.760
I love the way you don't care...

00:22:48.834 --> 00:22:52.600
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:22:52.771 --> 00:22:56.332
| would follow you anywhere.

00:22:56.675 --> 00:23:02.671
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:12.190 --> 00:23:13.589
I am Tiger!

00:23:13.658 --> 00:23:16.753
Yeesh! I just can't understand
these Japoness people!

00:23:16.828 --> 00:23:20.025
They're holding a New Year's
marionette contest, of all things!

00:23:20.532 --> 00:23:22.227
What?! Commander Goddel!

00:23:22.300 --> 00:23:25.497
You're saying we saber dolls
must participate in this contest?!

00:23:25.570 --> 00:23:28.005
Well, orders are orders! But...

00:23:28.073 --> 00:23:30.872
But... This outfit is embarrassing!

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:36.505
Welcome The New Year! The Otaru Cup
Marionette Contest Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:23:36.581 --> 00:23:38.640
Otaru Mamiya, you'll pay for this!
